# Text and log files (Databricks job logs, captured stdout/stderr, ad-hoc dumps)
*.log
*.log.gz
*.txt

# Any directory whose name starts with `__` (e.g. __pycache__, __MACOSX, ...).
# Files starting with __ (like __init__.py, __main__.py) are NOT matched
# because the trailing slash restricts the rule to directories.
__*/

# Reports are generally ignored: they're huge encrypted blobs regenerated by
# the SPA and not meant to live in source control. The first demo report is
# the one exception -- keep it in git as a worked example. Anything else
# under reports/ is ignored.
reports/*
!reports/2026-05-27_2026-06-10/
reports/2026-05-27_2026-06-10/*
!reports/2026-05-27_2026-06-10/20260529-112130-13launches/
